{"aliases":["BM25","BM25 检索","Okapi BM25"],"external_ids":{},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"seed: BM25, RRF, cross-encoder reranking, LangGraph","op":"insert","reason":"resolve 无候选","run_id":"r_20261108_xy6xwx"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261108_xy6xwx","expanded_at":null,"how":"得分 = Σ IDF(词项)·词频饱和项，参数 k1 控制饱和速度，b 控制长度归一化强度。","id":"n_01m6x5q6wkc4mwmggs","importance":4,"kind":"method","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"BM25","name_zh":"BM25 检索","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.205496+00:00","slug":"bm25","status":"active","summary":"基于词频、逆文档频率和文档长度归一化的经典稀疏词项检索打分函数。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261108_xy6xwx","what":"对查询中每个词项，按其逆文档频率加权，并对词频做饱和处理、对文档长度做归一化，累加成文档得分。","why":"纯词频会让长文档和高频词占便宜，而稀有词才最能区分文档。BM25 用饱和的词频和长度归一化修正这两点，成为无需训练、可倒排索引加速的强基线，但无法匹配同义改写。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.75,"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m6x5q6zwcjw7n73a","other_id":"n_01m5eh84ssxcph4zgw","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Dense Retrieval","other_name_zh":"稠密检索","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"dense-retrieval","other_summary":"把查询和文档编码成向量、按向量相似度检索的方法。","rationale":"二者是并行的两条检索路线：BM25 做词项匹配的全文检索，稠密检索做向量相似度检索，混合检索把两者结合。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Hybrid Search Scoring (RRF) - Azure AI Search","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/hybrid-search-ranking"}],"type":"alternative_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.9,"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m6x5q708t9kwcrbt","other_id":"n_01m6x5q6wkya5pawc6","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","o